### Describe the bug

SimplifyExpr & Fixer should skip ParenExpr at ExportDefaultExpr

### Input code

```typescript
import someFunction from './b';

export default (function someFunction () {
});
```




### Expected behavior

Transform by SimplifyExpr & Fixer should be the origin code.

``` js
import someFunction from './b';

export default (function someFunction () {
});
```

### Actual behavior

But print the below code, the semantics has changed.
``` js
import someFunction from './b';

export default function someFunction () {
};
```

### Version

master code
